        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
        <section id="implementation-stage"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Implementation stage
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>This is the stage during which the product is actually built. The actions which take place during the implementation stage are:</p>
<ol>
<li>The steps for product development outlined in the DDS are allocated to members of the IT team.</li>
<li>The programmers then write, test, and debug the allocated parts of the project code using the specified programming language.</li>
<li>Depending on the SDLC model which is used, they work together to bring the separate aspects together to form a beta (test) version of the product.</li>
</ol>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u1_s3_p2_image1.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
  
        <section id="key-point"  class="t-bg-grey i-keypoint">
          
            <h2>
    
    <!-- THEME ICON MACRO keypoint -->
