        <section id="maintenance-stage"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Maintenance stage
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>When the product is released, it must then be maintained. Support is often included as part of the agreement between the client and the company who actually developed the software. It is vital to ensure that the product is maintained to ensure:</p>
<ol>
<li>To provide support when bugs or errors arise in the software.</li>
<li>The product keeps up with changing software compatibility and dependencies</li>
<li>To add extra functionality.</li>
<li>Possibly to adapt the software or write modules or plugins based on the users needs.</li>
</ol>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u1_s3_p2_image2.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </section>
        
    
     
    

